(707, 'plain prata', 'review', 'Refined-flour items may be low fibre, but the specific local item is not directly addressed and preparation/fat can matter. Modification: Check the exact hospital protocol; do not infer permission from fibre content alone. Common ambiguity: Fat/oil content and flour type vary. Pending clinical review. Is this refined-flour item acceptable when plain and without high-fibre fillings/garnishes?', 'NUH', 'National University Hospital — Preparing for Your Colonoscopy booklet (https://www.nuh.com.sg/docs/nuhlibraries/brochures-document/colonoscopy-colonoscopy-preparation_peb_eng_a5_v2_fa.pdf)', '2026-09-16T17:33:24.724092+00:00'),
