(946, 'apple juice (clear, no pulp)', 'review', 'SKH permits light-coloured apple/pear juice; NUH adult booklet broadly says fruit juices to avoid before clear-liquid phase but clear-liquid lists vary; paediatric NUH permits clear apple juice. Modification: Check the exact hospital protocol; do not infer permission from fibre content alone. Hospital sheets conflict — follow your own hospital''s form. Pending clinical review. Which pulp-free fruit juices are permitted during the clear-liquid phase, and what colours are acceptable?', 'SKH', 'Sengkang General Hospital — Diet Advice (https://www.skh.com.sg/ward-stay/admissions/preparing-for-colonoscopy/diet-advice)', '2026-09-16T17:33:24.724092+00:00'),
