(1034, 'potato', 'review', 'NUH/HealthHub lists potatoes as allowed simple carbohydrates, while SKH says avoid all vegetables and does not carve out potato. Modification: Check the exact hospital protocol; do not infer permission from fibre content alone. Common ambiguity: Does peeling/cooking change the answer? Hospital sheets conflict — follow your own hospital''s form. Pending clinical review. Are peeled potatoes permitted during the low-residue phase under the target protocol?', 'DIETICIAN', 'Consolidated baseline — National University Hospital — Colorectal Cancer / bowel preparation guidance (https://www.nuh.com.sg/health-resources/diseases-and-conditions/colorectal-cancer); HealthHub (contributed by NUH) — Screening for Colorectal Cancer (https://www.healthhub.sg/well-being-and-lifestyle/personal-care/screening_colorectal_cancer_nuhs); Sengkang General Hospital — Diet Advice (https://www.skh.com.sg/ward-stay/admissions/preparing-for-colonoscopy/diet-advice)', '2026-09-16T17:33:24.724092+00:00'),
(1035, 'sweet potato', 'cannot', 'Adult SKH/NUH guidance excludes vegetables during the low-residue period. Modification: Avoid during the stated phase unless your hospital explicitly instructs otherwise. Common ambiguity: Starchy vegetable; not specifically resolved in adult local protocols. Hospital sheets conflict — follow your own hospital''s form. Pending clinical review. Are any peeled, well-cooked vegetables permitted under the intended adult protocol, or should all vegetables be excluded?', 'DIETICIAN', 'Consolidated baseline — Sengkang General Hospital — Diet Advice (https://www.skh.com.sg/ward-stay/admissions/preparing-for-colonoscopy/diet-advice); National University Hospital — Preparing for Your Colonoscopy booklet (https://www.nuh.com.sg/docs/nuhlibraries/brochures-document/colonoscopy-colonoscopy-preparation_peb_eng_a5_v2_fa.pdf); National University Hospital — Paediatric colonoscopy food and drinks diet (https://www.nuh.com.sg/docs/nuhlibraries/content-document/care-at-nuh/specialties/paediatrics/150421_nuh-a5-colonoscopy-booklet-lowres-preview-%281%29.pdf?sfvrsn=10781797_1)', '2026-09-16T17:33:24.724092+00:00'),
